Placeholder so git tracks docs/_static/.

conf.py sets html_static_path = ['_static']. Git does not track empty
directories, so without this file the directory is absent from a fresh clone and
Sphinx warns "html_static_path entry '_static' does not exist" -- which fails the
build under the fail_on_warning setting in /.readthedocs.yaml. Delete this file
only if you also drop html_static_path from conf.py.
